    "rejected": {
      "2": "Full raw contains a distinct projecting human nose bridge and rounded bulb above the handlebar moustache. Replace that nose anatomy with the smooth noseless mascot face while retaining single cigar-clenching mouth, brown short swept-back hair/separate brows/curled moustache, bare chin, lit brown cigar projecting screen left with grey smoke, rust-red broad-lapel suit/cream shirt/olive tie, screen-left three-quarter gaze/crop/light/full dark-grey backing and broad natural collar fit. Tiny cigar ember/cloth detail and subtle cheek mark precision are unreadable limits, not an asserted extra defect. Full unchanged raw/white/cyan/alpha solid255 with no transparency/backing failure.",
      "3": "Full raw draws realistic red human lips with a distinct cupid-bow upper lip and fleshy creased lower lip, contrary to the user-reference simple single mascot mouth. Convert that anatomy to one small mascot wedge mouth retaining the source slight smile/parting. Keep middle-parted brown hair visible inside grey hood/headscarf, separate brows, round pale-metal spectacles with green mascot eyes, burgundy floral scarf wrap/knot, taupe coat/pale pointed collar/grey inner cloth and two grey buttons, screen-right pose/crop/light/full dark-grey backing and short broad collar contact. Tiny floral petals/button relief unreadable; human lip anatomy itself is clearly visible. Entire raw/mattes solid255, no hole/backing loss.",
      "4": "Full raw retains a large realistic human ear on screen right beneath the grey-blonde hair, with helix/concha/lobe, and red human cupid-bow/fleshy lip anatomy. Remove the human ear while retaining the pearl stud attached to smooth mascot side-head, and use one small mascot mouth conveying the source slight smile. Keep rolled grey-blonde crown curls/back shoulder curls, separate brows, round dark brown glasses with exactly one green eye pair behind lenses, burgundy checked button blouse, pale grey rounded collar/olive buttons, pose/crop/light/full dark-grey vignette and short broad collar fit. Tiny pearl reflection/check pattern weave unreadable; visible human anatomy is clear. Full raw/white/cyan/alpha solid255 without holes/backing loss."
